{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Shareable Trip Artifacts\n      The #1 viral driver. Auto-generated \"My Cape Cod Week\" summary cards, photo stamps with location/date overlays, and bingo completion graphics designed for Instagram/TikTok. AllTrails grew to 65M users largely through shareable content loops.\n      \n        Why it worksEvery share = free marketingFOMO drives downloadsFamilies already take photos — this adds the app brand","choice":"social-sharing","id":null,"timestamp":1773200960303}
{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"B\n    \n      Live Beach Status Feed\n      Solves Cape Cod's #1 pain point. Crowdsourced or estimated parking availability, crowd level, and real-time conditions per beach. \"Is Nauset full yet?\" is the question every Cape visitor asks every morning. No app answers it.\n      \n        Why it worksDaily utility = daily opensSolves a real, urgent problemCreates word-of-mouth (\"this app told me Skaket had parking\")","choice":"beach-status","id":null,"timestamp":1773200964736}
