{"source":"user-event","type":"click","text":"D\n    \n      Tide-Smart Day Planner\n      The \"aha moment\" feature. Auto-schedules your day around tide tables so you never miss Brewster Flats, arrive at the wrong tide, or waste time. \"Visit Skaket at 2pm when the flats are out, then sunset at Rock Harbor at 7:30.\" No other app does this.\n      \n        Why it worksUnique — no competitor offers thisPrevents the #1 tourist mistake (wrong tide)Creates shareable itineraries","choice":"tide-planner","id":null,"timestamp":1773200970474}
